From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MichaIng <micha@dietpi.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:09:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mm: ksm: include aml_cma.h for cma_page()

With CONFIG_KSM=y and CONFIG_AMLOGIC_CMA=y, cma_page() is used without declaration, which fails with -Werror=implicit-function-declaration. Include the header, like other mm/ sources do. Hardkernel's odroidc5_defconfig has KSM disabled, so this was never hit there.
---
 mm/ksm.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mm/ksm.c b/mm/ksm.c
index c046cd70a..834ae8137 100644
--- a/mm/ksm.c
+++ b/mm/ksm.c
@@ -43,6 +43,9 @@
 #include <linux/pagewalk.h>
 
 #include <asm/tlbflush.h>
+#ifdef CONFIG_AMLOGIC_CMA
+#include <linux/amlogic/aml_cma.h>
+#endif
 #include "internal.h"
 #include "mm_slot.h"
 
-- 
Armbian

